{"id":"s2.2.1","slug":"sum-of-series","title":"Sum of Series","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Memorizing formulas for the sums of special series is crucial for solving many problems quickly. Here are some of the most common ones:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li><strong>First m Integers:</strong> $\\sum_{n=1}^{m} n = \\frac{m(m+1)}{2}$</li><li><strong>First m Odd Integers:</strong> $\\sum_{n=1}^{m} (2n-1) = m^2$</li><li><strong>First m Even Integers:</strong> $\\sum_{n=1}^{m} 2n = m(m+1)$</li><li><strong>First m Squares:</strong> $\\sum_{n=1}^{m} n^2 = \\frac{m(m+1)(2m+1)}{6}$</li><li><strong>First m Cubes:</strong> $\\sum_{n=1}^{m} n^3 = (\\frac{m(m+1)}{2})^2$</li><li><strong>Infinite Geometric Series:</strong> $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_1 d^n = \\frac{a_1}{1-d}$ for $|d| < 1$</li></ul>","summary":"Memorizing formulas for the sums of special series is crucial for solving many problems quickly.","generation_guideline":"Generate a sum of a series of numbers (e.g., consecutive integers, even numbers, odd numbers, squares, or cubes).","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $2 + 4 + 6 + 8 + \\dots + 22$.","answer":"132","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + \\dots + 21$.","answer":"231","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $1 + 3 + 5 + 7 + \\dots + 25$.","answer":"169","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":4,"text":"The 25th term of 3, 8, 13, 18, ... is:","answer":"123","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $6 + 4 + \\frac{8}{3} + \\frac{16}{9} + \\dots$.","answer":"18","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $2 + 4 + 6 + 8 + \\dots + 30$.","answer":"240","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $1 + 3 + 5 + 7 + \\dots + 19$.","answer":"100","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{3}{5} - \\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{3}{20} - \\dots$.","answer":"2/5","ki